n Yazd.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/sharaf-al-din-mahmud-shah"><span class="enc-name">Sharaf al-Din Mahmud Shah</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">Sharaf al-Din Mahmud Shah was the founder of the Injuid dynasty in Fars, southern Iran.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/sharaf-al-din-qaraqush"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/sharaf-al-din-qaraqush.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Sharaf al-Din Qaraqush</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">Sharaf al-Din Qaraqush was an Armenian-born mamluk who carved out a domain in Tripolitania and southern Ifriqiya.</span></a></li></ul>
